 meaning 2; principles/steps 3; application 2; verification 1. Confirm against official teaching material before use."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning and purpose (2 marks):** functions of system blocks appears in “Optical Fiber Communication Fundamentals”. Define its role and features, relate it to Blocks of optical fiber communication system, optical fiber transmission characteristics, losses in optical fiber links, bending losses, provide a practical example and state one process/design check or limitation. Confirm the details against official teaching material.\n\n**Principles/procedure (3 marks):** Explain the concept in logical order and relate it to Blocks of optical fiber communication system, optical fiber transmission characteristics, losses in optical fiber links, bending losses, Optical Fiber Communication Fundamentals. Include the relevant conditions, components, operating variables or formulas.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a concrete Optical and Satellite Communication task and describe the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check against the stated objective and mention a limitation, error source or safety/design trade-off.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles/steps 3; application 2; verification 1. Confirm against official teaching material before use."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning and purpose (2 marks):** optical fiber transmission characteristics appears in “Optical Fiber Communication Fundamentals”. Define its role and features, relate it to Blocks of optical fiber communication system, functions of system blocks, losses in optical fiber links, bending losses, provide a practical example and state one process/design check or limitation. Confirm the details against official teaching material.\n\n**Principles/procedure (3 marks):** Explain the concept in logical order and relate it to Blocks of optical fiber communication system, functions of system blocks, losses in optical fiber links, bending losses, Optical Fiber Communication Fundamentals. Include the relevant conditions, components, operating variables or formulas.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a concrete Optical and Satellite Communication task and describe the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check against the stated objective and mention a limitation, error source or safety/design trade-off.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles/steps 3; application 2; verification 1. Confirm against official teaching material before use."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning and purpose (2 marks):** losses in optical fiber links appears in “Optical Fiber Communication Fundamentals”. Define its role and features, relate it to Blocks of optical fiber communication system, functions of system blocks, optical fiber transmission characteristics, bending losses, provide a practical example and state one process/design check or limitation. Confirm the details against official teaching material.\n\n**Principles/procedure (3 marks):** Explain the concept in logical order and relate it to Blocks of optical fiber communication system, functions of system blocks, optical fiber transmission characteristics, bending losses, Optical Fiber Communication Fundamentals. Include the relevant conditions, components, operating variables or formulas.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a concrete Optical and Satellite Communication task and describe the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check against the stated objective and mention a limitation, error source or safety/design trade-off.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles/steps 3; application 2; verification 1. Confirm against official teaching material before use."'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

